creature Inventory
  traits
    capacity is a number
    items_held is a number
  end traits

  when born
    give self the trait capacity to 3
    give self the trait items_held to 0
  end born

  action add_item
    when self items_held < self capacity
      give self the trait items_held to self items_held + 1
      say "Item added to inventory. Space used: " + self items_held + "/" + self capacity
    otherwise
      say "Inventory full! Cannot carry more items."
    end when
  end action

  action drop_item
    when self items_held > 0
      give self the trait items_held to self items_held - 1
      say "Item dropped. Space used: " + self items_held + "/" + self capacity
    otherwise
      say "Inventory is already empty!"
    end when
  end action
end creature

bring Backpack to life as Inventory

Backpack does add_item
Backpack does add_item
Backpack does add_item
Backpack does add_item
Backpack does drop_item
Backpack does add_item
